Hugin's Vibes Build Pak -- licensing

The build scripts in this repository (Dockerfile, build.sh, check-upstreams.sh,
pak/selftest.sh, manifest.jq, warmup/, the workflow) are:

  Copyright (c) 2026 Brian Miller
  MIT License -- see "MIT License (this repository)" below.

The RELEASED TARBALL (phvalheim-vibes-buildpak-<version>-linux-x64.tar.gz) is an
AGGREGATE of third-party software redistributed unmodified in binary form. Each
component keeps its own license, reproduced or referenced below. The versions are
in the tarball's manifest.json (components.*).

