dotnet/   .NET SDK (Microsoft)                                   MIT License
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  https://github.com/dotnet/sdk  --  https://github.com/dotnet/runtime
  Copyright (c) .NET Foundation and Contributors. Licensed under the MIT License;
  the full text ships inside the pak as dotnet/LICENSE.txt and
  dotnet/ThirdPartyNotices.txt. Microsoft's own binary redistribution terms:
  https://github.com/dotnet/core/blob/main/license-information.md
  The pak omits dotnet/sdk/<ver>/FSharp, dotnet/shared/Microsoft.AspNetCore.App
  and dotnet/packs/Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Ref (unused by a BepInEx plugin build).

