------------------------------------------------------------------------------
What is NOT in the pak and why (design section 1)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  No Valheim assembly (assembly_valheim.dll, assembly_*.dll), no UnityEngine*.dll,
  no game data. They are Iron Gate / Unity Technologies copyrighted material and
  may not be redistributed. The server harvests them from a world's own
  dedicated-server install, which every operator already has a license for.

